		<item>
			<title>Madonna's Truth or Dare Fragrance commercial: Watch her as Dita again!</title>
			<link>http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/701-madonnas-truth-or-dare-fragrance-commercial-watch-her-as-dita-again.html</link>
			<guid>http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/701-madonnas-truth-or-dare-fragrance-commercial-watch-her-as-dita-again.html</guid>
			<description><![CDATA[<div class="K2FeedIntroText"><p>If you still have some doubt, <strong>Dita</strong> is definitely back with the commercial of <strong>Madonna's Truth or Dare fragrance</strong>. The ad features her latest single, Girl Gone Wild. Enjoy and post you comments after the jump...</p>
<p> </p>
<p>{youtube}KEdKyeGHewc{/youtube}</p></div>]]></description>
