		<item>
			<title>Madonna &amp; Lola want you to be the next Model for Material Girl Collection</title>
			<link>http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/191-madonna-and-lola-want-you-to-be-the-next-model-for-material-girl-collection.html</link>
			<guid>http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/191-madonna-and-lola-want-you-to-be-the-next-model-for-material-girl-collection.html</guid>
			<description><![CDATA[<div class="K2FeedIntroText"><p><strong>Madonna</strong> and her daughter <strong>Lola</strong> are looking for a brand new model for their <strong>Material Girl collection</strong>. Be their next Lucky Star! Watch this official clip where Madonna is absolutely Stunning!</p>
<p> </p>
<p>{youtube}UJ5cwjDbwq4{/youtube}</p>
<p> </p>
<p>If you want to be the next <strong>Material Girl</strong>, you can apply for one of 5 live castings in New York, Los Angeles, Chicago, San Francisco and Miami. The first open casting is on November 2nd (5 PM) at Macy's in New York. The second casting is on November 4th (6 PM) at Macy's in Miami. The third casting is on November 8th at Macy's in Chicago. The forth casting is on November 12th (2 PM) at Macy's in San Francisco. And the final casting is on November 19 at Macy's in Los Angeles.</p>
<p> </p>
<p>Prizes includes: a trip to New York for a custom photo-shoot, your <strong>Material Girl</strong> ad in the coolest magazines, you'll be the face of <strong>Material Girl</strong> in stores and online, a billboard in Times Square, $5,000 in cash and much more.</p>
<p> </p>
<p>Enter online at <a href="http://www.materialgirlcollection.com" target="_blank">Materialgirlcollection.com</a>.</p></div>]]></description>
			<category>Merchandising</category>
			<pubDate>Fri, 28 Oct 2011 00:25:31 +0000</pubDate>
		</item>
		<item>
			<title>Madonna's True or Dare Perfume</title>
			<link>http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/95-madonnas-true-or-dare-perfume.html</link>
			<guid>http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/95-madonnas-true-or-dare-perfume.html</guid>
			<description><![CDATA[<div class="K2FeedIntroText"><p>Reading Jeanne Becker report of her incredible night and dinner with <strong>Madonna</strong> in <strong>Toronto</strong>, and other guests tweets, including Flare Editor-in-Chief Lisa Tant, we learn about <strong>Madonna's True or Dare perfume</strong>.</p>
<p> </p>
<p>"<strong>Madonna</strong> then gave a couple of sample spritzes of her upcoming <strong>Truth or Dare perfume</strong>, which smells of gardenias," says Jeanne Beker.</p>
<p> </p>
<p>"<strong>Madonna</strong> spritzed her new scent, <strong>Truth or Dare</strong>, on my wrist. Took it out of her clutch &amp; grabbed my wrist. Gardenia, tuberose, musk," tweeted Lisa Tant. "I told <strong>Madonna</strong> that her scent smells like the movie - fabulous, sexy &amp; a little violent. She loved that."</p></div>]]></description>
			<category>Merchandising</category>
			<pubDate>Wed, 14 Sep 2011 09:41:59 +0000</pubDate>
		</item>
	</channel>
